<title>POLAND: ZEW trade suspended on Thursday.</title>
<headline>ZEW trade suspended on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw bourse suspended trade in electrode maker ZEW SA on Thursday, a bourse representative said, adding that more details would be provided at 1230 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
